DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 on four DGX Sparks (vLLM)

The scripts, tests, documentation and our patches docker/0001-*.patch to docker/0006-*.patch and
docker/0008-*.patch (0001-deepseek-v41-reasoning-effort-minimal-medium, 0002-model-loader-weight-snapshots,
0003-spec-decode-block-residual-mass-lookahead-bound, 0004-spec-decode-block-verification-step-seeds,
0005-deepseek-v41-ced-skip-unread-nonfinal-chunks, 0006-deepseek-v41-dspark-no-mtp-hidden-buffer,
0008-v1-engine-persistent-prefix-kv-cache) in this repository are licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(see LICENSE).

The serving engine is built by docker/Dockerfile from the third-party components below. Each is fetched at
image build at the pinned commit or digest and patched unmodified; none is redistributed in this repository,
and each remains under its own license.

- spark-ds41f by Christopher Owen (https://github.com/christopherowen/spark-ds41f), Apache-2.0, at commit
  2dc95329610188451a5c5f5af98e5c392144809c, release r6w (experiments/2026-10-18-r6w-swiglu): the build preparation
  (bin/spark), the image recipe (docker/Dockerfile, whose build stages docker/Dockerfile here follows), the
  patch series for every component below, the serving configuration, and the memguard scripts shipped in
  the image under /opt/spark-ds41f.
- vLLM (Apache-2.0, the vLLM project), via Local Inference Lab's fork
  (https://github.com/local-inference-lab/vllm, branch integration/karmic-kraken-beta, commit
  19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354), with spark-ds41f's r6w vLLM series (173 patches: r6v's 172 plus
  0181, the routed SwiGLU and MXFP8 cast over the live tiles), then spark-ds41f's lossless MoE scale-codes
  overlay by Christopher Owen (Apache-2.0; commit a250ace70424475c04b0919fc9a46f23c19e51da,
  experiments/2026-10-18-scale-codes/overlay: vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/tilelang.py and
  vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/tilelang/{gemm,moe}.py, copied unmodified and pinned by sha256; the routed
  experts' scales as row bases and 4-bit codes), then our docker/0003-*.patch to docker/0006-*.patch (two
  upstream vLLM fixes ported, two prefill savings of ours), then spark-ds41f's DSpark profile-replays overlay
  by Christopher Owen (Apache-2.0; commit 2ce3644fa361290b0024f0ee784b17b63c8b2882,
  experiments/2026-10-18-dspark-profile-replays/overlay: vllm/v1/worker/gpu/spec_decode/adaptive_verification.py,
