  graph-captured shape instead of 5), then docker/0007-dspark-adaptive-verification-linear-row-cost-budget.patch:
  spark-ds41f's vLLM patch 0184 by Christopher Owen (Apache-2.0; commit 03e8775c9f2c9a791bb49a2f4d97575020ec0f7b,
  experiments/2026-10-18-r6x/vllm; the change of his experiments/2026-10-18-dspark-linear-budget/overlay at
  commit 53ef3558f4ca56f244cfb1566061199ad9a8975f), his authorship kept, rebased by us onto the tree above (the
