  budget by a fixed linear step cost, the speculative config's adaptive_verification_row_cost in place of the
  boot-timed cost curves, then our docker/0008-v1-engine-persistent-prefix-kv-cache.patch (the prefix KV
  cache saved before a stop and restored at start); and the vLLM
  nightly image docker.io/vllm/vllm-openai@sha256:3cf14c52765a0f0c2f09035e05fa79e1e4b2f9788b64afa90fa41c1ff12d29cf
